{"id": "NXe1YaaJm", "sessionId": "073035c5-bcb9-5f0f-7c7d-23790be28455", "turnId": "f5e1a22f-4265-4c20-8db0-7da3e33431ad", "createdAt": 1789591350446, "updatedAt": 1789591350458, "generationStatus": "completed", "relatedEntryId": null, "type": "effect", "title": "bash", "detail": {"toolName": "bash", "display": {"summary": "bash: cat ./src/content/en/api/endpoint/audio/voices/page.mdx", "content": null, "suffix": "", "verb": "Running", "message": "cat ./src/content/en/api/endpoint/audio/voices/page.mdx", "settledVerb": "Ran", "settledMessage": "cat ./src/content/en/api/endpoint/audio/voices/page.mdx", "statusText": "Running command"}, "kind": "shell", "input": {"command": "cat ./src/content/en/api/endpoint/audio/voices/page.mdx"}}, "state": {"status": "completed", "output": {"stdout": "---\ntype: api\ntitle: Audio Voices\ndescription: Welcome to Mistral AI's Api Reference\n---\nimport {\n  CodeSample,\n  CodeSampleTab,\n  CodeSampleTabbedSection,\n  ExpandableBreakout,\n  ExpandableBreakoutDescription,\n  ExpandableBreakoutProperties,\n  ExpandableBreakoutTitle,\n  ExpandableProperty,\n  ExpandablePropertyBreakouts,\n  ExpandablePropertyDefaultValue,\n  ExpandablePropertyDescription,\n  ExpandablePropertyExamples,\n  ExpandablePropertyTitle,\n  ExpandableSection,\n  FrontMatterDisplayType,\n  Operation,\n  OperationCodeSamplesSection,\n  OperationDescriptionSection,\n  OperationParametersSection,\n  OperationRequestBodyDescriptionSection,\n  OperationRequestBodyExamplesSection,\n  OperationRequestBodySection,\n  OperationResponseBodyDescriptionSection,\n  OperationResponseBodyDisplayTypeSection,\n  OperationResponseBodyExamplesSection,\n  OperationResponseBodySection,\n  OperationSummarySection,\n  OperationTitleSection,\n  Pill,\n  ResponseExamplesTab,\n  ResponseExamplesTabbedSection,\n  ResponseTab,\n  ResponseTabbedSection,\n  Section,\n  SectionContent,\n  SectionTitle,\n  Tag,\n  TagDescription,\n  TagTitle,\n  SDKVersionCodeSample\n} from \"@/app/[locale]/(api)/components/speakeasy\";\n\n<Tag slot=\"tag\">\n\n<TagTitle slot=\"title\">\n\n# Audio Voices Endpoints\n\n</TagTitle>\n\n<TagDescription slot=\"description\">\n\nAPI for voice management.\n\n</TagDescription>\n\n</Tag>\n\n<Operation>\n\n<OperationTitleSection slot=\"title\">\n\n## <Pill variant=\"primary\"><b>GET</b></Pill> /v1/audio/voices \\{#operation-list_voices_v1_audio_voices_get\\}\n\n</OperationTitleSection>\n\n<OperationSummarySection slot=\"summary\">\n\n_List all voices_\n\n</OperationSummarySection>\n\n<OperationDescriptionSection slot=\"description\">\n\nList all voices (excluding sample data)\n\n</OperationDescriptionSection>\n\n<OperationCodeSamplesSection slot=\"code-samples\">\n\n<CodeSampleTabbedSection>\n\n<CodeSampleTab\n  slot=\"tab\"\n  id=\"operation-list_voices_v1_audio_voices_get_code-samples_typescript\"\n  tags={{\"codeSample\":\"typescript\"}}\n>\n\nTypeScript\n\n</CodeSampleTab>\n\n<SectionContent\n  slot=\"content\"\n  id=\"operation-list_voices_v1_audio_voices_get_code-samples_typescript\"\n>\n\n<CodeSample>\n\n```typescript\nimport { Mistral } from \"@mistralai/mistralai\";\n\nconst mistral = new Mistral({\n  apiKey: \"MISTRAL_API_KEY\",\n});\n\nasync function run() {\n  const result = await mistral.audio.voices.list({});\n\n  console.log(result);\n}\n\nrun();\n\n```\n\n</CodeSample>\n\n</SectionContent>\n\n<CodeSampleTab\n  slot=\"tab\"\n  id=\"operation-list_voices_v1_audio_voices_get_code-samples_python\"\n  tags={{\"codeSample\":\"python\"}}\n>\n\nPython\n\n</CodeSampleTab>\n\n<SectionContent\n  slot=\"content\"\n  id=\"operation-list_voices_v1_audio_voices_get_code-samples_python\"\n>\n\n<SDKVersionCodeSample>\n<div data-version=\"v2\">\n<CodeSample>\n\n```python\nfrom mistralai.client import Mistral\nimport os\n\n\nwith Mistral(\n    api_key=os.getenv(\"MISTRAL_API_KEY\", \"\"),\n) as mistral:\n\n    res = mistral.audio.voices.list(limit=10, offset=0, type_=\"all\")\n\n    # Handle response\n    print(res)\n\n\n```\n\n</CodeSample>\n</div>\n\n</SDKVersionCodeSample>\n\n</SectionContent>\n\n<CodeSampleTab\n  slot=\"tab\"\n  id=\"operation-list_voices_v1_audio_voices_get_code-samples_curl\"\n  tags={{\"codeSample\":\"curl\"}}\n>\n\ncURL\n\n</CodeSampleTab>\n\n<SectionContent slot=\"content\" id=\"operation-list_voices_v1_audio_voices_get_code-samples_curl\">\n\n<CodeSample>\n\n```curl\ncurl https://api.mistral.ai/v1/audio/voices \\\n -X GET \\\n -H 'Authorization: Bearer YOUR_APIKEY_HERE'\n```\n\n</CodeSample>\n\n</SectionContent>\n\n</CodeSampleTabbedSection>\n\n</OperationCodeSamplesSection>\n\n<OperationParametersSection slot=\"parameters\">\n\n<Section>\n\n<SectionTitle slot=\"title\">\n\n### Parameters \\{#operation-list_voices_v1_audio_voices_get_parameters\\}\n\n</SectionTitle>\n\n<SectionContent slot=\"content\">\n\n<ExpandableSection>\n\n<ExpandableProperty\n  slot=\"entry\"\n  id=\"limit\"\n  headingId=\"operation-list_voices_v1_audio_voices_get_parameters_limit\"\n  typeInfo={{\"label\":\"integer\",\"linkedLabel\":\"integer\",\"children\":[],\"breakoutSubTypes\":{}}}\n  typeAnnotations={[{\"title\":\"query\",\"variant\":\"info\"}]}\n  hasExpandableContent={true}\n  expandByDefault={false}\n>\n\n<ExpandablePropertyTitle slot=\"title\">\n\n##### limit \\{#operation-list_voices_v1_audio_voices_get_parameters_limit\\}\n\n</ExpandablePropertyTitle>\n\n<ExpandablePropertyDescription slot=\"description\">\n\nMaximum number of voices to return\n\n</ExpandablePropertyDescription>\n\n</ExpandableProperty>\n\n<ExpandableProperty\n  slot=\"entry\"\n  id=\"offset\"\n  headingId=\"operation-list_voices_v1_audio_voices_get_parameters_offset\"\n  typeInfo={{\"label\":\"integer\",\"linkedLabel\":\"integer\",\"children\":[],\"breakoutSubTypes\":{}}}\n  typeAnnotations={[{\"title\":\"query\",\"variant\":\"info\"}]}\n  hasExpandableContent={true}\n  expandByDefault={false}\n>\n\n<ExpandablePropertyTitle slot=\"title\">\n\n##### offset \\{#operation-list_voices_v1_audio_voices_get_parameters_offset\\}\n\n</ExpandablePropertyTitle>\n\n<ExpandablePropertyDescription slot=\"description\">\n\nOffset for pagination\n\n</ExpandablePropertyDescription>\n\n</ExpandableProperty>\n\n<ExpandableProperty\n  slot=\"entry\"\n  id=\"type\"\n  headingId=\"operation-list_voices_v1_audio_voices_get_parameters_type\"\n  typeInfo={{\"label\":\"enum\",\"linkedLabel\":\"enum\",\"children\":[{\"label\":\"\\\"all\\\"\",\"linkedLabel\":\"\\\"all\\\"\",\"children\":[],\"breakoutSubTypes\":{}},{\"label\":\"\\\"custom\\\"\",\"linkedLabel\":\"\\\"custom\\\"\",\"children\":[],\"breakoutSubTypes\":{}},{\"label\":\"\\\"preset\\\"\",\"linkedLabel\":\"\\\"preset\\\"\",\"children\":[],\"breakoutSubTypes\":{}}],\"breakoutSubTypes\":{}}}\n  typeAnnotations={[{\"title\":\"query\",\"variant\":\"info\"}]}\n  hasExpandableContent={true}\n  expandByDefault={false}\n>\n\n<ExpandablePropertyTitle slot=\"title\">\n\n##### type \\{#operation-list_voices_v1_audio_voices_get_parameters_type\\}\n\n</ExpandablePropertyTitle>\n\n<ExpandablePropertyDescription slot=\"description\">\n\nFilter the voices between customs and presets\n\n</ExpandablePropertyDescription>\n\n</ExpandableProperty>\n\n</ExpandableSection>\n\n</SectionContent>\n\n</Section>\n\n</OperationParametersSection>\n\n<OperationResponseBodyExamplesSection slot=\"response-body-examples\">\n\n<ResponseExamplesTabbedSection>\n\n<SectionTitle slot=\"title\">\n\n### Responses Examples \\{#operation-list_voices_v1_audio_voices_get_responses-examples\\}\n\n</SectionTitle>\n\n<ResponseExamplesTab\n  slot=\"tab\"\n  id=\"operation-list_voices_v1_audio_voices_get_responses-examples_200_application-json\"\n  tags={{\"responseExample\":\"200:application/json\"}}\n>\n\n200\n\n</ResponseExamplesTab>\n\n<SectionContent\n  slot=\"content\"\n  id=\"operation-list_voices_v1_audio_voices_get_responses-examples_200_application-json\"\n>\n\n```json\n{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"created_at\": \"2025-12-17T10:25:07.818693Z\",\n      \"id\": \"019b2bd7-96e7-7219-8